{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 32, "title": "Beam workflows with local snapshot fixtures", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.0, "o", "Local fixtures: plan, saved return, review, undo, and conflict recovery.\r\nNo sandbox is allocated. Provider transfer and cleanup are not demonstrated.\r\n\r\n"]
[2.5, "o", "$ beam up --to daytona --agent shell --yes --detach\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "▸ project     /tmp/beam-example/home/dev/app\r\n▸ destination daytona\r\n▸ session     shell workspace (no agent session)\r\n\r\nSend: complete reachable Git history, staged and unstaged changes, and untracked files.\r\nReturn: remote Git work. Beam combines supported separate edits and saves conflicts for review.\r\nStay local: running processes, databases, and ignored build output.\r\n▸ worktree    0 changed paths\r\n▸ env         none\r\n▸ setup       none\r\n▸ verify      1 project checks\r\nDetails: add --details, or run beam doctor --to daytona --agent shell\r\n▸ check       checking destination prerequisites…\r\n✗ check       checking destination prerequisites 0.0s\r\n✗ Daytona requires DAYTONA_API_KEY in your shell environment: environment variable not found\r\n"]
[7.5, "o", "\r\nThe following fixture starts with an already downloaded return package.\r\n"]
[10.0, "o", "$ beam down --review --detach\r\n"]
[12.5, "o", "▸ review      saving remote work and preparing the return plan…\r\n0 extra or agent files need review\r\nRemote work is saved locally.\r\n\r\n2 paths changed remotely\r\n0 paths changed locally\r\nNext: beam review --apply\r\n  remote: \"README.md\"\r\n  remote: \"remote.txt\"\r\nRemote worktree: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/clean-return/worktree\r\nProposed result (inspection copy): /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/clean-return/candidates/16e9dc22927325c02e210882b3be72661c545cac3b8a0831f380afef2a370541\r\nLocal project files are unchanged. The remote session is stopped.\r\n"]
[15.0, "o", "$ beam review --diff\r\n"]
[17.5, "o", "diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\r\nindex 5738f75..85c2ef9 100644\r\n--- a/README.md\r\n+++ b/README.md\r\n@@ -1 +1,2 @@\r\n Hello from the local workspace.\r\n+Change from the sandbox.\r\ndiff --git a/remote.txt b/remote.txt\r\nnew file mode 100644\r\nindex 0000000..cd60a7b\r\n--- /dev/null\r\n+++ b/remote.txt\r\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\r\n+A new file to review.\r\n"]
[20.0, "o", "$ beam review --apply --keep\r\n"]
[22.5, "o", "▸ review      saving remote work and preparing the return plan…\r\n▸ worktree    remote changes applied\r\n✓ Remote work applied to /tmp/beam-example/home/dev/app.\r\nSandbox kept for inspection: ssh://fixture.\r\nFurther sandbox edits will not return through beam down.\r\nRecovery receipt: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/clean-return\r\n◆ Home again · 0 commits · 2 paths · 1m away · 0 conflicts\r\nNext: cd /tmp/beam-example/home/dev/app\r\n"]
[25.0, "o", "$ beam undo\r\n"]
[27.5, "o", "✓ Local state restored. Returned work remains in /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/clean-return/worktree.\r\n"]
[30.0, "o", "\r\nA second downloaded fixture changes the same path locally and remotely.\r\n"]
[32.5, "o", "$ beam down --keep --detach\r\n"]
[35.0, "o", "▸ review      saving remote work and preparing the return plan…\r\n! Return finished with saved recovery. Local changes were preserved.\r\nSaved recovery: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return\r\n! local Git state changed; remote work is in /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\nRemote worktree: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\nSandbox kept for inspection: ssh://fixture.\r\nFurther sandbox edits will not return through beam down.\r\nRecovery receipt: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return\r\n◆ Home again · 0 commits · 2 paths · 1m away · 1 conflict\r\nNext: cd /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\n✗ return finished with conflicts; see the recovery paths above\r\n"]
[37.5, "o", "$ beam status\r\n"]
[40.0, "o", "Local changes were preserved. Saved recovery is available for review.\r\nSaved recovery: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return\r\n! local Git state changed; remote work is in /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\nRemote worktree: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\nNext: cd /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\n"]
[42.5, "o", "$ beam review\r\n"]
[45.0, "o", "Remote work is saved locally.\r\n\r\n2 paths changed remotely\r\n1 paths changed locally\r\nManual integration is required. Open the saved work with beam review --open.\r\nNext: beam review --open\r\n  remote: \"README.md\"\r\n  remote: \"remote.txt\"\r\n  local:  \"README.md\"\r\n! README.md\r\nRemote worktree: /tmp/beam-example/home/.beam/transfers/conflict-return/worktree\r\nReview the saved worktree. After manual integration: beam review --resolved\r\n"]
[47.5, "o", "$ beam review --diff\r\n"]
[50.0, "o", "diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\r\nindex 5738f75..85c2ef9 100644\r\n--- a/README.md\r\n+++ b/README.md\r\n@@ -1 +1,2 @@\r\n Hello from the local workspace.\r\n+Change from the sandbox.\r\ndiff --git a/remote.txt b/remote.txt\r\nnew file mode 100644\r\nindex 0000000..cd60a7b\r\n--- /dev/null\r\n+++ b/remote.txt\r\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\r\n+A new file to review.\r\n"]
[52.5, "o", "$ # Integrate the saved work through your editor, then acknowledge recovery.\r\n"]
[55.0, "o", "$ beam review --resolved\r\n"]
[57.5, "o", "✓ Recovery marked resolved. Saved copies remain available.\r\n"]
[60.0, "o", "$ beam status\r\n"]
[62.5, "o", "Workspace is local.\r\nNext: beam\r\n"]
